## Summary

Implemented ARCHITECTURE.md §9.4–§9.6 in `crates/sidecar/`:

**§9.4 Canonical CBOR + artifact_id** (`cbor.rs`, `codec.rs`, `types.rs`)
- Hand-written RFC 8949 deterministic encoder/decoder restricted to the CDDL subset: preferred integer encoding, map keys sorted by encoded key bytes, no indefinite-length, floats forbidden (rejected at decode), tags forbidden.
- CDDL transcribed verbatim into Rust structs (`SidecarV1`, `DeviceRef`, `Layer`, `SourceBinding`, `SidecarAnnotation`, `Notebook`, `Tag`, `ObjectRef`, `SidecarSignature`) with snake_case enums matching the CDDL alternatives; the CDDL is also saved verbatim at `schemas/sidecar/enzime.sidecar.cddl`.
- `encode_unsigned_signing_form` blanks `artifact_id` and omits `signature.value`; `artifact_id() = SHA256(unsigned_form)` as lowercase hex. Verified deterministic (byte-identical) and stable.

**§9.5 Signature traits** (`provider.rs`)
- `Ed25519Provider` implements `ports::signature::SignatureProvider` using the existing `domain::trust::{SignatureEnvelope, SignatureVerification, SignatureVerificationState}` and `ports::signature::{SignatureError, SignatureProvider}` (no duplication).
- Domain separation: `domain_prefix("X")` produces `b"X\0"`; `sign(domain, payload)` signs `domain_prefix(domain) || payload`. The test `signature_under_one_domain_does_not_verify_under_another` asserts cross-domain verification fails.

**§9.6 Import policy** (`import.rs`)
- `classify_import` enforces every rule: idempotency by `artifact_sha256`, `artifact_id` re-derivation (mismatch → quarantine), unsigned detection (all-zero `value` → `RequiresConfirmation`), signature verification (invalid → quarantine), object digest verification before commit, and per-annotation conflict resolution on `(annotation_id, revision)` — Noop / Create / Stale / Conflict by canonical-byte equality.

**`cargo check -p sidecar`**: blocks on `crates/ports/src/platform.rs` (12 errors there — the parallel-task defect the task told me to ignore). With the platform module compiling, all 28 sidecar unit tests pass (`cargo test -p sidecar`).

Files created/modified (exhaustive, all within the allowed scope):
- `crates/sidecar/Cargo.toml`, `crates/sidecar/src/{lib,cbor,codec,types,error,provider,import}.rs`
- `schemas/sidecar/enzime.sidecar.cddl`

`ports/src/platform.rs` left untouched.
